# is the ONLY other record of these edits (they were never committed there).
#
# NOT consumed by scripts/gen_vendor.sh (pulp-sdk is a software toolchain
# component, not vendored RTL). Apply manually on a fresh SDK checkout:
#   git clone https://github.com/FondazioneChipsIT/pulp-sdk && cd pulp-sdk
#   git checkout d5df6a3
#   git apply 0001-esp-chip-target-pulp_esp.patch
